# Metadata Cleaner (GTK 4): notifications and its own names. No portals: it writes the cleaned copy
# next to the original, which the document portal can't give it.
include notify
own fr.romainvigier.MetadataCleaner
own fr.romainvigier.MetadataCleaner.*
# GTK's own file chooser: local mounts only, no GVfs monitors (they are not on its bus)
env gio-local
